# AGENTS.md

Agent instructions for this repository live in two places; read both before
changing anything, and do not duplicate their content here.

- [CLAUDE.md](CLAUDE.md) — the standing rules (what this repo is, what you must
  never do) and the index of every other doc.
- `.claude/skills/project-development/SKILL.md` — the task-oriented guide: the
  local loop, Flux debugging, and the conventions the shipped manifests follow.

`.claude/settings.json` ships too. It is a starting permission allowlist for
Claude Code: read-only git, kubectl and flux calls allowed, deploying and
default-branch pushes denied or asked. Review it and edit it to taste.
